  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The sum of the given series $1^2+2.2^2+3^2+$ $2.4^2+5^2+2.6^2+\\ldots \\ldots . .+2(2 m)^2$ is $\\frac{2 m\\left(2 m+1^2\\right.}{2} \\leqslant m\\left(2 m+1^2\\right)$",
    "image": null
  },
